9. TIME RANGE STANDARD

Use appropriate default ranges.

Recommended defaults:

- Overview: last 1 hour
- Operational dashboards: last 1–4 hours
- Trend dashboards: last 24 hours
- Daily analysis: last 24 hours
- Weekly analysis: last 7 days
- Cost analysis: last 7–30 days depending on data volume

Never default to All Time without a strong reason.

Allow users to change the time range through dashboard controls.

---

10. REFRESH STANDARD

Do NOT configure aggressive automatic refresh.

Use automatic refresh only for true monitoring/NOC dashboards.

Recommended examples:

- NOC/real-time operational dashboard: 1–5 minutes
- Standard operational dashboard: manual or 5–15 minutes
- Analytical dashboard: manual
- Cost dashboard: hourly/daily depending on data freshness

Do not use real-time searches simply because the dashboard is operational.

